{"4596270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tire Service Simulator", "steam_appid": 4596270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a tire service empire from scratch. From a local workshop to servicing the heaviest machinery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the sound of an impact wrench your favorite music? Welcome to the team, where grease under your fingernails is your trademark, and customer satisfaction is the ultimate reward. Your life revolves around rubber, air, and rims – and in a world where every mile puts tires to the test, you are the only thing standing between a driver and their destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More than just changing tires</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a workshop is an art. You must not only precisely diagnose issues and patch punctures, but also manage your time and resources. Whether it's a simple flat tire or a complex structural failure – your accuracy determines road safety. Every bolt must be torqued, and every tire pressure perfectly adjusted to the conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/147cfcbefaeab3640ef6dc11915aa606.poster.avif?t=1787742124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/147cfcbefaeab3640ef6dc11915aa606.webm?t=1787742124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/147cfcbefaeab3640ef6dc11915aa606.mp4?t=1787742124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfection in every detail</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision measured in grams. Every wheel balance is your signature – eliminate the slightest vibrations and give your customers the handling confidence they expect. Remember: nothing ruins a drive like steering wheel vibrations at 120 km/h that you can feel in your teeth. Make sure every wheel leaves your workshop perfectly balanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/d683d4afb73a959b283239af6f2407d6.poster.avif?t=1787742124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/d683d4afb73a959b283239af6f2407d6.webm?t=1787742124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/d683d4afb73a959b283239af6f2407d6.mp4?t=1787742124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Give rims a second life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheels are the showcase of every car! Show your attention to detail by transforming damaged, mud-covered rims into real gems. Remove stubborn dirt, polish the chrome, and make sure every vehicle leaves your shop looking like it just rolled out of a showroom. Your workshop is where technical precision meets aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/6d112f9a668e5f8e80747ccf76337c23.poster.avif?t=1787742124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/6d112f9a668e5f8e80747ccf76337c23.webm?t=1787742124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/6d112f9a668e5f8e80747ccf76337c23.mp4?t=1787742124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mobile tire service rescue</strong>     </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the phone rings, there's no time to hesitate. Jump behind the wheel of your fully equipped mobile service van and hit the road! Working in harsh weather conditions, in the middle of a highway, or deep in the forest requires composure and speed. Will you manage to reach the customer before their patience runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/9d6ad4c35df5198e5e9bee34d5b805a7.poster.avif?t=1787742124\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/9d6ad4c35df5198e5e9bee34d5b805a7.webm?t=1787742124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/9d6ad4c35df5198e5e9bee34d5b805a7.mp4?t=1787742124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue road giants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think changing a tire on a city car is a challenge? It's time to level up. Tackle tires from massive agricultural machinery, off-road vehicles, and multi-ton trucks. This is a job for a true professional – it requires specialized equipment, strength, and expertise that others simply don't have. Prove that nothing is impossible in your workshop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596270/extras/6eeb2d13d36105770fa90f1443166d8b.poster.avif?t=1787742124\" width=800 height=450 ><source sr